  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together soy sauce, chili flakes, and sesame oil.",
    "In a separate bowl, whisk together eggs and a pinch of salt and pepper.",
    "In a 9x13 inch baking dish, add the shrimp and drizzle with the soy sauce mixture.",
    "Pour the egg mixture over the shrimp and smooth the top.",
    "Bake for 12-15 minutes, or until the eggs are set and the shrimp are cooked through.",
    "Sprinkle green onions on top and serve hot."
